Detects whether a component was built using GitHub Actions that are known to be vulnerable or otherwise unsafe. The check recognizes inline SHA pinning and workflow-scoped actions.lock v0.0.3 coverage, and checks applicable recorded commits for vulnerabilities. Locking does not establish that an action is safe or verify its upstream provenance. The policy evaluates `mcn_githubactions_vulnerabilities_1` and reports a passed/failed result for the component when applied.
